{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08441","headline":"送当涂赵少府赴长芦 · 李白","name":"送当涂赵少府赴长芦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我来扬都市，送客回轻舠。\n因夸楚太子，便覩广陵涛。\n仙尉赵家玉，英风凌四豪。\n维舟至长芦，目送烟云高。\n摇扇对酒楼，持袂把蟹螯。\n前途傥相思，登岳一长谣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}